# Rozdarte Sumienie — session data held back from the public site until the
# players return their corrections and the GM approves publishing (2026-07-15).
# The files stay on disk so the local builders (build-session-vault, kit) work;
# they are NOT published. To publish: drop these lines, commit the files, and
# add the session back to public/transcripts/data/variants.json.
public/transcripts/data/rozdarte-sumienie-current-overlay.json
public/transcripts/scene-index/rozdarte-sumienie.json
public/gallery/rozdarte-sumienie.json
public/img/rozdarte-sumienie/
public/audio/rozdarte-sumienie/
docs/superpowers/drafts/

# Vault snapshot — refreshed by `npm run build-content`.
# Both the generated content.ts AND public/vault-attachments/ ARE committed so
# the repo is self-sufficient: a fresh clone (and the production build) has the
# tutorial images without needing access to the GM's G:\ Obsidian vault.
# Re-running `npm run build-content` updates them from the vault.

